<div class="content">
  <h1>${$global.title}</h1>
  <div class="content-body" no-parse>
    <h1 id="getting-started" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#getting-started">#</a> Getting Started</h1>
<p>Welcome to MarkoPress! This guide will help you get up and running quickly.</p>
<h2 id="installation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#installation">#</a> Installation</h2>
<p>Install MarkoPress using your favorite package manager:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6A737D"># npm</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">npm</span><span style="color:#032F62"> install</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> -g</span><span style="color:#032F62"> markopress</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6A737D"># pnpm</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">pnpm</span><span style="color:#032F62"> add</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> -g</span><span style="color:#032F62"> markopress</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span class="line"></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6A737D"># yarn</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="8"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">yarn</span><span style="color:#032F62"> global</span><span style="color:#032F62"> add</span><span style="color:#032F62"> markopress</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="9"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="quick-start" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#quick-start">#</a> Quick Start</h2>
<p>Create a new site with a single command:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">markopress</span><span style="color:#032F62"> init</span><span style="color:#032F62"> my-site</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#005CC5">cd</span><span style="color:#032F62"> my-site</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">pnpm</span><span style="color:#032F62"> install</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6F42C1">pnpm</span><span style="color:#032F62"> dev</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="project-structure" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#project-structure">#</a> Project Structure</h2>
<p>Your new site will have the following structure:</p>
<pre><code>my-site/
├── markopress.config.js
├── package.json
└── content/
    ├── pages/
    ├── docs/
    └── blog/
</code></pre>
